      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e796c5c5db943731",
      "translationZh": "有关 Quanto 的详细介绍，请参阅这篇文章。简而言之，Quanto 是一个基于 PyTorch 构建的量化工具包。它是 Hugging Face Optimum 的一部分，后者是一套用于硬件优化的工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e218bb32a2969ee",
      "translationZh": "模型量化是 LLM 从业者常用的工具，但在扩散模型中应用得还不多。Quanto 可以帮助弥合这一差距，在几乎不降低甚至完全不降低质量的情况下节省内存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c548d3a9974e717d",
      "translationZh": "为进行基准测试，我们使用一块 H100 GPU，环境如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cbfe54c293846382",
      "translationZh": "Diffusers（从此提交安装）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "94fafd184e78c5a3",
      "translationZh": "Quanto（从此提交安装）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "525ed1cd33ff01ad",
      "translationZh": "除非另有说明，我们默认使用 FP16 进行计算。我们选择不对 VAE 进行量化，以避免数值不稳定问题。我们的基准测试代码可在此处找到。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0d467b362357049",
      "translationZh": "截至本文撰写时，Diffusers 中提供了以下基于 Transformer 的文生图扩散流水线：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b3811f4a4236076",
      "translationZh": "PixArt-Alpha 和 PixArt-Sigma",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a1c3f0b154fea7a",
      "translationZh": "我们还有 Latte，这是一个基于 Transformer 的文本生成视频流水线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5d629c9bd8736e1",
      "translationZh": "为简洁起见，我们将研究范围限定为以下三种模型：PixArt-Sigma、Stable Diffusion 3 和 Aura Flow。下表列出了它们的扩散骨干网络的参数量：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee325afd9b4e907b",
      "translationZh": "检查点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e70be46516ed8f46",
      "translationZh": "参数量（十亿）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cccf3ede261f2d80",
      "translationZh": "值得注意的是，本文主要关注内存效率，代价是推理延迟略有增加，或增加幅度可忽略不计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3aaefdd14e820d82",
      "translationZh": "使用 Quanto 对 DiffusionPipeline 进行量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8de61a20dba1b8dd",
      "translationZh": "使用 Quanto 对模型进行量化很简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad25ae4ba51cc07d",
      "translationZh": "我们对要量化的模块调用 quantize()，指定要量化的内容。在上面的例子中，我们只量化参数，保持激活值不变。我们将其量化为 FP8 数据类型。最后，我们调用 freeze()，用量化后的参数替换原始参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f61047ac61f3161",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们就可以正常调用这个流水线：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9854cf729273ca06",
      "translationZh": "采用 FP8 的扩散 Transformer",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dee7556282d41287",
      "translationZh": "我们注意到，使用 FP8 时，内存占用有如下节省，延迟略有增加，而质量几乎没有下降：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
