    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00e893bf5c8c1e9d",
      "translationZh": "对文本编码器进行量化，得到的结果与前一种情况非常相似：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a7c3866c7f087c6d",
      "translationZh": "这些观察结果的普适性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fc9882760348afc",
      "translationZh": "对于我们测试过的模型，同时量化文本编码器和扩散骨干网络通常是可行的。Stable Diffusion 3 是一个特例，因为它使用了三个不同的文本编码器。我们发现，量化第二个文本编码器的效果不佳，因此建议采用以下替代方案：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24f60415cf018e8b",
      "translationZh": "仅量化第一个文本编码器（CLIPTextModelWithProjection），或者",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0e6e1c40a6930346",
      "translationZh": "仅量化第三个文本编码器（T5EncoderModel），或者",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
