    {
      "id": "b0178",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "647e002286a0b867",
      "translationZh": "在 H100 上，bfloat16 通常更好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0179",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e0160fa6566a19b",
      "translationZh": "对于 H100 或 4090 等支持 bfloat16 的 GPU 架构，使用 bfloat16 可以更快。下表列出了在我们的 H100 参考硬件上测得的一些 PixArt 数据：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0180",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4857cd1742f94da",
      "translationZh": "批量大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0181",
