    },
    {
      "id": "b0210",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9e7584cfa266b59",
      "translationZh": "qint8 的潜力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0211",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9554acdbf93595c9",
      "translationZh": "我们发现，使用 qint8（而非 qfloat8）进行量化，在推理延迟方面通常表现更好。当我们对注意力机制的 QKV 投影进行横向融合（在 Diffusers 中调用 fuse_qkv_projections()），从而增大 int8 内核的维度以加速计算时，这一效果会更加明显。下面我们展示一些 PixArt 的相关实验数据：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0212",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4857cd1742f94da",
      "translationZh": "批大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0213",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3e4d9d8b7ebe9c2",
      "translationZh": "量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0214",
