    },
    {
      "id": "b0240",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cbc87c7681f34db",
      "translationZh": "真",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0241",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cbc87c7681f34db",
      "translationZh": "真",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0242",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2d80bf3ddc1a93b4",
      "translationZh": "INT4 的表现如何？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0243",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "371adb2deed1db4e",
      "translationZh": "我们还在使用 bfloat16 时对 qint4 进行了实验。这仅适用于 H100 上的 bfloat16，因为目前尚不支持其他配置。使用 qint4 时，我们可以预期内存占用会进一步降低，但代价是推理延迟增加。延迟增加是意料之中的，因为硬件并不原生支持 int4 计算——权重以 4 位形式传输，但计算仍以 bfloat16 进行。下表展示了我们在 PixArt-Sigma 上的测试结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0244",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4857cd1742f94da",
      "translationZh": "批大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0245",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87dc244625ecfb0d",
      "translationZh": "量化 TE",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0246",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94b205cadab5750b",
      "translationZh": "内存（GB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0247",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fec604cb626ec0a4",
      "translationZh": "延迟（秒）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0249",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ea442a134b2a184",
      "translationZh": "否",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0253",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85a39ab345d672ff",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0256",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e77ab9365f757050",
      "translationZh": "不过，请注意，由于 INT4 的离散化程度很高，最终结果可能会受到影响。因此，对于基于 Transformer 的模型，我们通常不对最终投影层进行量化。在 Quanto 中，我们通过以下方式实现这一点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0257",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89bd7a59d2f0e428",
      "translationZh": "\"proj_out\" 对应 pipeline.transformer 中的最后一层。下表展示了各种设置下的结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0258",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd8b1ffb2f3f2015",
      "translationZh": "量化 TE：否，排除层：无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0259",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0e7a80479b8ebe4",
      "translationZh": "量化 TE：否，排除层：\"proj_out\"",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0260",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb8a3da0ecb50f06",
      "translationZh": "量化 TE：是，排除层：无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0261",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3205b21a5a1a1d00",
      "translationZh": "量化 TE：是，排除层：\"proj_out\"",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0266",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7ad0061e90d8a9b",
      "translationZh": "为了恢复损失的图像质量，一种常见做法是进行量化感知训练，Quanto 也支持这种方法。这项技术不在本文的讨论范围内，如果你感兴趣，欢迎联系我们！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0267",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fbcaa2e350f7fb0",
      "translationZh": "本文所有实验的结果都可以在这里找到。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0268",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "40d14bd9a06fb182",
      "translationZh": "附加内容——在 Quanto 中保存和加载 Diffusers 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0269",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41e6fda92bfb9d89",
      "translationZh": "量化后的 Diffusers 模型可以保存和加载：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0270",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a05024c7f8ced29f",
      "translationZh": "生成的检查点大小为 587MB，而原始大小为 2.44GB。然后我们可以加载它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0271",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fabfc88bdea0e911",
      "translationZh": "并在 DiffusionPipeline 中使用它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0272",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bc96d2f5d0c238c",
      "translationZh": "未来，我们有望在初始化流水线时直接传入 transformer，从而让以下方式可行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0273",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4197a5a3a8c0d400",
      "translationZh": "QuantizedPixArtTransformer2DModel 的实现可在此处查看，以供参考。如果你希望 Quanto 支持保存和加载更多 Diffusers 模型，请在此处提交 issue，并提及 @sayakpaul。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0274",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3838a4d8cb8c5ccc",
      "translationZh": "技巧",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0275",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d86bbaf65f04edaf",
      "translationZh": "根据你的需求，你可能希望对不同的流水线模块应用不同类型的量化。例如，你可以对文本编码器使用 FP8，而对扩散 Transformer 使用 INT8。得益于 Diffusers 和 Quanto 的灵活性，这可以无缝实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0276",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f44534a36e122fbe",
      "translationZh": "为了针对你的使用场景进行优化，你甚至可以将量化与 Diffusers 中的其他内存优化技术结合使用，例如 enable_model_cpu_offload()。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0277",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0278",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cdf40e38256cb1a",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们展示了如何量化 Diffusers 中的 Transformer 模型，并优化其内存消耗。当我们进一步量化其中涉及的文本编码器时，量化的效果会更加明显。希望你能将其中的一些工作流程应用到自己的项目中，并从中受益 🤗。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0279",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6816363b3b754dde",
      "translationZh": "感谢 Pedro Cuenca 对本文进行的全面审阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
